===Etymology===
{{ja-kanjitab|まど|yomi=k|kyu=窻|alt=窗,牕,牖}}

From {{inh|ja|ojp|sort=まど|-}}. Compound of {{ja-com|sort=まど|目|ま|t1=[[eye]]|pos1=ancient combining form of modern {{ja-r|目|め}}|門|linkto2=戸|と|t2=[[gate]], [[opening]]}}, in reference to an opening for looking through.<ref name="K">{{R:Kojien}}</ref><ref name="DDJS">{{R:Digital-Daijisen}}</ref><ref name="KDJ">{{R:Kokugo Dai Jiten}}</ref>

Alternatively, may be a compound of {{ja-com|sort=まど|間|ま|t1=[[gap]]|門|と|linkto2=戸|t2=[[gate]], [[opening]]}}.<ref name="K"/><ref name="KDJ"/><ref name="SMK5"/>

First cited in some references to a text from 794,<ref name="KDJ2">{{R:Nihon Kokugo Daijiten 2|窓・窗・牖}}</ref> and also found in the ''{{w|Man'yōshū}}'' of 759.<ref>{{RQ:Manyoshu|11|2679}}, available online [https://web.archive.org/web/20210927132020/http://jti.lib.virginia.edu/japanese/manyoshu/Man11Yo.html#2679 here]</ref>

The ''Microsoft Windows'' sense is a {{sl|ja|en|sort=まど|nocap=1|Windows}}.

